        title={'en': 'Module M5 — Cyber Academy & Quizzes', 'om': 'Moojulii M5 — Akadaamii Saayibarii fi Gaaffilee', 'am': 'ሞጁል M5 — የሳይበር አካዳሚ እና ፈተናዎች'},
        summary={'en': 'Module M5 delivers bite-sized interactive cybersecurity lessons and quizzes across five foundational domains: Phishing, Passwords, Incident Response, Simulated Defense, and Online Habits.', 'om': 'Moojuliin M5 barnoota saayibarii gaggabaaboo fi gaaffilee qormaataa damee 5 irratti dhiyeessa: Fiishiingii, Jecha Icciitii, Deebii Balaa, fi Amala Intarneetii.', 'am': 'ሞጁል M5 አጫጭር የሳይበር ደህንነት ትምህርቶችንና ፈተናዎችን በ5 ዋና ዋና ዘርፎች ያቀርባል፡ ፊሺንግ፣ የይለፍ ቃላት፣ የጥቃት ምላሽ፣ እና አስተማማኝ የበይነመረብ አጠቃቀም።'},
        details={'en': 'Each quiz question provides immediate pedagogical explanations upon selection. Progress is scored locally in your browser with zero telemetry by default.', 'om': 'Gaaffileen hundi deebii isaanii wajjin ibsa gabaabaa qabu. Qabxiin kee moobaayila kee keessatti qofa qabama.', 'am': 'እያንዳንዱ ጥያቄ ማብራሪያ አለው። ውጤትዎ በስልክዎ ላይ ብቻ የሚቀመጥ ሲሆን ምንም አይነት መረጃ ወደ ውጭ አይላክም።'},
        examples={'en': 'Example quiz topic: Identifying when an urgent SMS warning from your telecom provider is actually a credential-harvesting trap.', 'om': "Fakkeenya gaaffii: Ergaan ariifachiisaan telekoomii irraa fakkaatee dhufe akkamitti kiyyoo ta'uu isaa beekna?", 'am': 'የጥያቄ ምሳሌ፡ ከቴሌኮም የተላከ የሚመስል አስቸኳይ መልእክት የማጭበርበሪያ ወጥመድ መሆኑን እንዴት ማወቅ ይቻላል?'},
        next_steps={'en': '1. Go to Learn in the navigation bar. 2. Choose a topic (Phishing, Password, Incident). 3. Complete the interactive challenges to test your defensive knowledge.', 'om': "1. Baafata irraa 'Learn' filadhu. 2. Mata-duree filadhu. 3. Gaaffilee deebisuun hubannoo kee mirkaneeffadhu.", 'am': "1. ከማውጫው ላይ 'ትምህርት' የሚለውን ይምረጡ። 2. ርዕስ ይምረጡ። 3. ጥያቄዎቹን በመመለስ እውቀትዎን ይፈትሹ።"},
        limitations={'en': 'M5 is an educational curriculum. It equips you with cybersecurity judgment but cannot fix compromised devices or actively block network attacks.', 'om': 'M5 barnoota qofa. Hubannoo siif kenna malee meeshaa miidhame ofiin hin suphu.', 'am': 'M5 ትምህርታዊ ፕሮግራም ነው። ግንዛቤን ያሳድጋል እንጂ የተጠቃውን ስልክ ወይም ኮምፒውተር በራሱ አያድንም።'},
        suggested_followups={'en': ['Tell me about Cyber Hero Journey', 'How do I earn XP?', 'What should I do next?'], 'om': ["Waa'ee Cyber Hero Journey natti himi", 'XP akkamitti argadha?', 'Tarkaanfii itti aanu maalan godha?'], 'am': ['ስለ ሳይበር ጀግና ጉዞ ንገረኝ', 'XP እንዴት ይሰበሰባል?', 'ቀጥሎ ምን ማድረግ አለብኝ?']},
