        title={'en': 'Cyber Hero Journey & Tactical Progression', 'om': 'Tarkaanfii Goota Saayibarii (Cyber Hero Journey)', 'am': 'የሳይበር ጀግና ጉዞ እና የተልእኮዎች ሂደት'},
        summary={'en': 'Cyber Hero Journey is an interactive mission campaign that trains you against realistic Ethiopian digital threats. Complete missions to earn XP, unlock defensive badges, and advance your rank.', 'om': "Cyber Hero Journey sagantaa leenjii yoo ta'u, balaawwan Itoophiyaa keessatti beekamoo ta'an ofirraa faccisuuf nama leenjisa. XP fi badhaasota argachuun sadarkaa kee guddisi.", 'am': 'የሳይበር ጀግና ጉዞ በኢትዮጵያ ውስጥ ያሉ እውነተኛ የሳይበር አደጋዎችን ለመከላከል የሚያዘጋጅ የተልእኮዎች ስልጠና ነው። ተልእኮዎችን በማጠናቀቅ ነጥብ (XP) እና ባጆችን ያግኙ።'},
        details={'en': 'The campaign features 6 core missions: M01 Scholarship Phishing, M02 Telecom SIM Upgrade Scam, M03 Fake Banking Bot, M04 Malicious Telegram APK, M05 Romance/Crypto Fraud, and M06 Executive Impersonation. It also includes an adaptive practice generator and 3D defense arena.', 'om': 'Ergaawwan 6 qaba: M01 Fiishiingii Iskolaarshiippii, M02 Gowwoomsaa Kaardii SIM, M03 Boottii Baankii Sobaa, M04 Appilikeeshinii Telegiraamii Sobaa, M05 Gowwoomsaa Jaalalaa/Kiriptoo, fi M06 Nama Fakkaachuu.', 'am': 'ስድስት ዋና ዋና ተልእኮዎችን ያካትታል፡ የነጻ ትምህርት ማጭበርበር፣ የሲም ካርድ ማታለል፣ የሐሰት ባንክ ቦት፣ አደገኛ የቴሌግራም ኤፒኬ፣ የፍቅርና ክሪፕቶ ማጭበርበር፣ እንዲሁም የመሪዎች ስም ማጥፋት።'},
        examples={'en': 'In Mission M01, student Sufian receives an urgent scholarship email asking for personal documents and registration fees. The learner must inspect the link structure and reject the scam.', 'om': 'Ergaa M01 keessatti barataan Sufiyaan jedhamu iskolaarshiippii sobaa dhufeef qorachuun kiyyoo jalaa baha.', 'am': 'በተልእኮ M01 ተማሪ ሱፊያን የሐሰት የነጻ ትምህርት እድል መልእክት ሲደርሰው ሊንኩን መርምሮ ወጥመዱን የማምለጥ ተግባር ያከናውናል።'},
        next_steps={'en': "1. Navigate to 'Cyber Hero' in the menu. 2. Select an active mission. 3. Review the scenario evidence, choose the safest defensive response, and level up your defensive rank.", 'om': "1. Baafata irraa 'Cyber Hero' filadhu. 2. Ergaa banaa filadhu. 3. Ragaa ilaaliitii deebii sirrii filachuun sadarkaa kee guddisi.", 'am': "1. ከማውጫው ላይ 'ሳይበር ጀግና' የሚለውን ይምረጡ። 2. ተልእኮ ይምረጡ። 3. ሁኔታውን መርምረው ትክክለኛውን መከላከያ በመምረጥ ደረጃዎን ያሳድጉ።"},
        limitations={'en': 'Missions are simulated educational scenarios. While based on real threat patterns, they operate in safe sandbox environments.', 'om': "Ergaawwan kun fakkeessaa barnootaatiif qophaa'aniidha.", 'am': 'ተልእኮዎቹ በእውነተኛ ሁኔታዎች ላይ የተመሰረቱ ትምህርታዊ የሙከራ ሁኔታዎች ናቸው።'},
        suggested_followups={'en': ['How does adaptive ML recommendation work?', 'What should I do next?', 'Tell me about M1'], 'om': ['Gorsi ML akkamitti hojjeta?', 'Tarkaanfii itti aanu maalan godha?', "Waa'ee M1 natti himi"], 'am': ['የML ምክረ-ሃሳብ እንዴት ይሰራል?', 'ቀጥሎ ምን ማድረግ አለብኝ?', 'ስለ M1 አስረዳኝ']},
